      "id": 12,
      "options": {
        "content": "## MLOps Retraining Pipeline\n\nCloses the MLOps feedback loop: shows retraining triggers, failures, model reloads, accuracy trends, A/B prediction split, and the link from drift detections to retraining events.\n\n### Key Panels\n| Panel | What to look for |\n|:------|:-----------------|\n| Retraining Triggers (7d) | Total retraining events. Split by reason: `scheduled` vs `drift` |\n| Retraining Failures (7d) | Should be 0. Any failure triggers `RetrainingFailed` alert |\n| Model Accuracy Over Time | Improvement after each retraining cycle should be visible |\n| Drift \u2192 Retraining | Correlation between drift detections and retraining events |\n| Predictions by Model Version | A/B split \u2014 shows which model version serves most traffic |\n\n**Data sources:** `retraining_triggers_total[trigger_reason]`, `retraining_failures_total`, `model_reloads_total`, `model_accuracy_gauge`, `drift_detections_total`, `labels_in_db_total`\n\n*Created: Session 10 \u2014 GF-NEW-2 (Sprint 4)*",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
